      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "An alarming discovery was recently made while spying in a Floran collective. A row of Floran warriors were lined up, which was normal enough; what wasn't was the weaponry they bared.For one, it was the array of weaponry; several tech levels higher than would be assumed for them."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "最近、フローランの集団でスパイをしていたときに、驚くべき発見がもたらされました。 フローラン戦士の列が並んでいた十分正常だった彼らが破壊した武器ではなかった一つには武器の配列があったいくつかの技術レベルは想定よりも高い"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "The second, and more harrowing realization was as such: The weapons were being operated by their POWERFUL THIGHS. One appeared to be an ordinary disc fed machine gun; operated by an accordion pump apparatus. The second was much more intimidating, taking the appearance of a buckshot"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "二番目は、より厳しい認識でした:武器は彼らの強力な太ももによって操作されていた。 一つは通常のディスク給電機銃のようで、アコーディオンポンプ装置によって作動していた。 二つ目は威圧的で銃撃戦の様相を呈し"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "shell inflated until with a loud retort scattering the entire payload across a scarecrow target. The most fearsome however, was the cannon. Even if it only shot round shot, it did cut though an entire cornfield as if it was merely the air."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "シェルが膨らんでカカシの標的にペイロード全体を散乱させるまで もっとも恐ろしかったのが大砲だった。 丸いショットしか撮れなかったとしても、まるで空気のようにトウモロコシ畑全体を切り抜けました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "Retreating to my scout ship wasn't going to be a quiet thing for sure, the sound of their weapon tests ringing out, rocking the air, and shaking my very being. Leaving their jungle huts safely out of my sight, it was only upon reaching the clearing where I had parked my shuttle that it now became clear that my choice of parking spot was a dire mistake. My personal shuttle, dented and firmly smashed up by runaway cannonballs,\nseveral of her systems damaged, the orbital engines nearly critically so. As I flee this planet of the damned, projectile warnings ring out from my Bitching Betty unit. But my shuttle is too damaged for anything but the laziest of evasions, I pray aloud that my ship won't be struck; the ablative plating already having been crumpled into a very expensive ball."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "偵察船に退却することは決して静かではなく、彼らの兵器テストの音が鳴り響き、空気を揺さぶり、そして私の存在を揺さぶる。 ジャングル小屋を無事に視界から出ていったのは、私が駐車スペースを空けていたクリアリングにたどり着いた時で、駐車スペースの選択がひどい間違いであることが明らかになったからです。 暴走した砲弾でくぼんでしっかりと破滅させました\n彼女のシステムのいくつかは損傷した軌道エンジンはほとんど危機的だった 私はこの惑星から逃げるときに、私のBitching Bettyユニットから発砲警告が鳴ります。 だが、シャトルは損傷がひどく、のろのろとした回避しかできない。船に命中しないでくれと、声に出して祈る。犠牲装甲は、既にひしゃげた、とてつもなく高価な塊になっていた。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
